**Affected versions**:


* All;

**Affected FxA versions**:


* 1.220.0;

**Prerequisites**:


* Be in a Mozilla VPN EU supported country;
* Have the browser language or system language set to one of the following languages: Fr/De/Es/It/Nl;
* Be on new Set up your Subscription page;

**Steps to reproduce**:
1. Observe the “Privacy Notice” label link;

**Expected result**:


* The “Privacy Notice” label link is displayed in the user language;

**Actual result**:


* The “Privacy Notice” label link is displayed in English, regardless of the user language;

**Notes**:


* This is reproducible on Subscription confirmation page as well;
* When clicking on the “Privacy Notice” link, the Privacy Notice page is displayed in the user language;
* See the attached screenshot.

